{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-monitoring-debugging","title":"同步监控与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/sync-monitoring-debugging","wordCount":1296,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"同步监控与调试\">同步监控与调试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>同步系统的可观测性覆盖三个维度：健康度（延迟、成功率、队列深度）、一致性（跨副本 checksum 校验、抽样比对）、故障定位（设备端 sync_log + 冲突审计表 + 平台调试工具链）。核心原则是同步失败是沉默的——不主动监测就无法发现，用户报告时已经太晚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步失败是沉默的\">同步失败是沉默的</h2><p>传统 API 调用失败时用户会立即看到错误提示。离线同步的失败模式完全不同——数据写入本地成功，UI 正常响应，但变更可能永远无法到达服务端。用户可能在数天后才发现数据在其他设备上缺失，此时已无法追溯原因。</p>\n<p>因此，同步系统的可观测性不是锦上添花，而是生产运行的基础设施。需要回答三个核心问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>同步健康度</strong>：当前有多少设备同步正常、多少滞后、多少失败</li>\n<li><strong>数据一致性</strong>：跨设备的数据副本是否一致，差异有多大</li>\n<li><strong>故障定位</strong>：某条数据同步失败的根本原因是什么</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"同步健康度指标体系\">同步健康度指标体系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Sync Lag</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last_success</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{now}} - t_{\\text{last\\_success}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last_success</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>&gt; 5 min</td>\n<td>设备与服务端的时间差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pending Queue Depth</td>\n<td><code>COUNT(mutation_queue)</code></td>\n<td>&gt; 100 条</td>\n<td>未推送变更积压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sync Success Rate</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>success</mtext><mtext>total</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{success}}{\\text{total}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0404em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">success</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>&lt; 95%</td>\n<td>推送成功率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conflict Rate</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>conflicts</mtext><mtext>writes</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{conflicts}}{\\text{writes}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">writes</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">conflicts</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>&gt; 5%</td>\n<td>冲突发生频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Round-Trip Sync Time</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>push_ack</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>mutation_created</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{push\\_ack}} - t_{\\text{mutation\\_created}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">push_ack</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mutation_created</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>P95 &gt; 30s</td>\n<td>端到端同步延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Divergence</td>\n<td>跨副本 checksum 比对</td>\n<td>任何不一致</td>\n<td>数据收敛失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;设备端采集&quot;&#10;        A[同步事件日志] --&gt; B[本地 Metrics Buffer]&#10;        B --&gt; C[定期上报]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;服务端聚合&quot;&#10;        C --&gt; D[时序数据库&lt;br/&gt;InfluxDB/Prometheus]&#10;        D --&gt; E[Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;Grafana]&#10;        D --&gt; F[告警规则&lt;br/&gt;Sync Lag &gt; 5min]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"设备端采集\"\n        A[同步事件日志] --&gt; B[本地 Metrics Buffer]\n        B --&gt; C[定期上报]\n    end\n    subgraph \"服务端聚合\"\n        C --&gt; D[时序数据库&lt;br/&gt;InfluxDB/Prometheus]\n        D --&gt; E[Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;Grafana]\n        D --&gt; F[告警规则&lt;br/&gt;Sync Lag &gt; 5min]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"设备端同步日志\">设备端同步日志</h2><p>在设备本地维护一张 <code>sync_log</code> 表，记录每次同步操作的关键信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE sync_log (&#10;    id          INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,&#10;    timestamp   INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;    direction   TEXT NOT NULL,  -- &#39;push&#39; | &#39;pull&#39;&#10;    status      TEXT NOT NULL,  -- &#39;success&#39; | &#39;failure&#39; | &#39;conflict&#39; | &#39;partial&#39;&#10;    record_count INTEGER,&#10;    bytes_transferred INTEGER,&#10;    duration_ms INTEGER,&#10;    error_code  TEXT,&#10;    error_detail TEXT,&#10;    cursor_before TEXT,&#10;    cursor_after TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 保留最近 7 天日志，自动清理&#10;CREATE TRIGGER trim_sync_log&#10;AFTER INSERT ON sync_log&#10;BEGIN&#10;    DELETE FROM sync_log WHERE timestamp &lt; strftime(&#39;%s&#39;, &#39;now&#39;, &#39;-7 days&#39;) * 1000;&#10;END;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sync_log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTOINCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    direction   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'push' | 'pull'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'success' | 'failure' | 'conflict' | 'partial'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    record_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bytes_transferred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    duration_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    error_code  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    error_detail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cursor_before </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cursor_after </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 保留最近 7 天日志，自动清理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TRIGGER</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trim_sync_log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AFTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INSERT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sync_log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sync_log </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strftime(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'now'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-7 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>日志查询示例——诊断同步失败模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 过去 24 小时的失败率按小时分布&#10;SELECT&#10;    strftime(&#39;%H&#39;, timestamp / 1000, &#39;unixepoch&#39;) AS hour,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS total,&#10;    SUM(CASE WHEN status = &#39;failure&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS failures,&#10;    ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN status = &#39;failure&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) * 100.0 / COUNT(*), 1) AS failure_rate&#10;FROM sync_log&#10;WHERE timestamp &gt; strftime(&#39;%s&#39;, &#39;now&#39;, &#39;-1 day&#39;) * 1000&#10;GROUP BY hour;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 过去 24 小时的失败率按小时分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    strftime(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%H'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unixepoch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> hour</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failure'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failures,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failure'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failure_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sync_log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strftime(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'now'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-1 day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> hour</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"冲突审计追踪\">冲突审计追踪</h2><p>每次冲突解决都必须记录审计日志，即使是自动解决的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>conflict_id</code></td>\n<td>唯一冲突标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>entity_type</code> / <code>entity_id</code></td>\n<td>冲突涉及的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>local_version</code></td>\n<td>本地版本（JSON 快照）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>remote_version</code></td>\n<td>远端版本（JSON 快照）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resolution_strategy</code></td>\n<td>使用的策略（LWW/merge/manual）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resolved_version</code></td>\n<td>最终采用的版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resolved_at</code></td>\n<td>解决时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>user_involved</code></td>\n<td>是否需要用户干预</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套审计日志在用户报告「数据丢失」时是唯一的追溯手段。<a href=\"../sync-engines/conflict-resolution-strategies\">冲突解决策略</a> 中的每种策略都应输出到此审计表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据一致性校验\">数据一致性校验</h2><p>定期验证跨设备数据一致性，检测「同步声称成功但数据实际不一致」的情况：</p>\n<h3 id=\"checksum-校验\">Checksum 校验</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Checksum</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>SHA256</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>id</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>updatedAt</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Checksum}(D) = \\text{SHA256}\\left(\\bigoplus_{r \\in D} \\text{hash}(r.\\text{id} \\| r.\\text{updatedAt})\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Checksum</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SHA256</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⨁</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">id</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">updatedAt</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>客户端定期计算本地数据集的 checksum 并与服务端比对。不一致时触发增量修复同步。</p>\n<h3 id=\"抽样比对\">抽样比对</h3><p>全量 checksum 在大数据集上开销大。替代方案是随机抽样：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Client → Server: 发送 100 条随机记录的 (id, version) 对&#10;Server → Client: 返回不一致的记录列表&#10;Client: 对不一致记录触发定向同步\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Client → Server: 发送 100 条随机记录的 (id, version) 对</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Server → Client: 返回不一致的记录列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Client: 对不一致记录触发定向同步</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"平台调试工具\">平台调试工具</h2><h3 id=\"ios-cloudkit-调试\">iOS CloudKit 调试</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CloudKit Console</td>\n<td>浏览记录、Zone、订阅；手动修改测试数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CLOUDKIT_DEBUG=1</code></td>\n<td>Xcode scheme 环境变量，打印详细 CK 日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>com.apple.coredata.cloudkit.debug</code></td>\n<td>UserDefaults 键，打印 CD-CK 映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Instruments → CloudKit</td>\n<td>性能分析 CloudKit 操作耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CKSyncEngine.state</code></td>\n<td>运行时查询 pending changes、sync status</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"android-workmanager-调试\">Android WorkManager 调试</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>adb shell dumpsys jobscheduler</code></td>\n<td>查看 JobScheduler 任务状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WorkManager Inspector (Android Studio)</td>\n<td>可视化查看 Worker 状态和历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WorkManager.getWorkInfosByTag()</code></td>\n<td>编程式查询 Worker 执行状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Database Inspector</td>\n<td>实时查看 SQLite 数据和 mutation queue</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"跨平台引擎调试\">跨平台引擎调试</h3><p>PowerSync 和 ElectricSQL 都提供 Dashboard 查看同步状态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PowerSync Dashboard</strong>：每用户的同步延迟、数据量、错误率</li>\n<li><strong>ElectricSQL Console</strong>：Shape 订阅状态、replication lag、客户端连接数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"生产环境告警规则\">生产环境告警规则</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    M[Metrics 流入] --&gt; R1{Sync Lag &gt; 5min?}&#10;    R1 --&gt;|是| A1[P2 告警:同步延迟]&#10;    M --&gt; R2{Pending Queue &gt; 500?}&#10;    R2 --&gt;|是| A2[P1 告警:队列积压]&#10;    M --&gt; R3{Success Rate &lt; 90%?}&#10;    R3 --&gt;|是| A3[P1 告警:同步大面积失败]&#10;    M --&gt; R4{Conflict Rate &gt; 10%?}&#10;    R4 --&gt;|是| A4[P3 告警:冲突率异常]&#10;    M --&gt; R5{Data Divergence detected?}&#10;    R5 --&gt;|是| A5[P1 告警:数据不一致]\">flowchart TD\n    M[Metrics 流入] --&gt; R1{Sync Lag &gt; 5min?}\n    R1 --&gt;|是| A1[P2 告警:同步延迟]\n    M --&gt; R2{Pending Queue &gt; 500?}\n    R2 --&gt;|是| A2[P1 告警:队列积压]\n    M --&gt; R3{Success Rate &lt; 90%?}\n    R3 --&gt;|是| A3[P1 告警:同步大面积失败]\n    M --&gt; R4{Conflict Rate &gt; 10%?}\n    R4 --&gt;|是| A4[P3 告警:冲突率异常]\n    M --&gt; R5{Data Divergence detected?}\n    R5 --&gt;|是| A5[P1 告警:数据不一致]</pre><p>告警分级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>P1</strong>（立即处理）：数据不一致、队列积压持续增长、大面积同步失败</li>\n<li><strong>P2</strong>（工作时间处理）：同步延迟超阈值、单设备同步失败</li>\n<li><strong>P3</strong>（下次迭代处理）：冲突率上升趋势、同步耗时增加</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"同步问题排查清单\">同步问题排查清单</h2><p>当用户报告「数据在另一台设备上没有」时的排查路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>确认写入是否成功落入 mutation queue（查本地 DB）</li>\n<li>确认 WorkManager/BGTask 是否执行了推送（查 sync_log）</li>\n<li>确认推送是否到达服务端（查服务端 access log）</li>\n<li>确认服务端是否处理成功（查冲突日志、error log）</li>\n<li>确认另一台设备是否拉取到变更（查另一端 sync_log）</li>\n<li>确认拉取后是否正确写入本地 DB（查另一端 Room/SwiftData）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每一步对应不同的故障原因和修复路径。<a href=\"bandwidth-battery-optimization\">带宽与电量优化</a> 中的调度限制（如电量过低暂停同步）也可能是延迟的原因——监控需要关联设备状态上下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>同步监控的核心是将沉默的失败变为可见的信号。设备端 sync_log 提供本地证据，冲突审计表保留合并历史，checksum 校验确保最终一致性，告警规则将异常及时暴露。排查清单从「写入是否入队」到「对端是否落库」的六步路径覆盖了同步链路的每个故障点。有效的监控体系是离线同步系统在生产环境中长期稳定运行的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"同步监控与调试","id":"同步监控与调试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"同步失败是沉默的","id":"同步失败是沉默的"},{"level":2,"text":"同步健康度指标体系","id":"同步健康度指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"设备端同步日志","id":"设备端同步日志"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突审计追踪","id":"冲突审计追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"数据一致性校验","id":"数据一致性校验"},{"level":3,"text":"Checksum 校验","id":"checksum-校验"},{"level":3,"text":"抽样比对","id":"抽样比对"},{"level":2,"text":"平台调试工具","id":"平台调试工具"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS CloudKit 调试","id":"ios-cloudkit-调试"},{"level":3,"text":"Android WorkManager 调试","id":"android-workmanager-调试"},{"level":3,"text":"跨平台引擎调试","id":"跨平台引擎调试"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境告警规则","id":"生产环境告警规则"},{"level":2,"text":"同步问题排查清单","id":"同步问题排查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨平台同步方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/cross-platform-sync-solutions"},"next":{"title":"带宽与电量优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/bandwidth-battery-optimization"}}